  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Juridisk r&#xe5;dgivare i Koso</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal expert to Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNMIK and Sweden have not been able to sign the Swedish standard agreement, as the UN Security Council Resolution 1244 (1999)give UNMIK the mandate to be the administrator of Kosovo. When Sida East visited Kosovo in early March 2002 it was decided that Swedish and UN legal officers together should develop suggestions on the issues related to claims and liability towards</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNMIK och Sida har inte slutit proceduravtal enligt Sidas mall som reglerar bist&#xe5;ndsverksamhet i Kosovo d&#xe5; SR resolution 1244 endast ger UNMIK mandat att administrera Kosovo.  N&#xe4;r Sida &#xd6;st bes&#xf6;kte Kosovo i mars &#xe5;r 2002 besl&#xf6;ts att svenska jurister tillsammans med FNs jurister skulle utarbeta f&#xf6;rslag p&#xe5; l&#xf6;sning av &#xe4;garansvar, krav och ansvar mot tredjeman.</narrative>
  </description>
